<p>Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad <br />
Karbobala me aapka sab ghar hua barbaad</p>

<p>1) Beemar-e-ghamo jour ko kaanto'n pa chalaya<br />
Raaho me kahi'n bhi na mila aapko saya<br />
Kya zulm sahe aap ne kaisi hui bedaad<br />
 Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad </p>

<p>
2) Be jurm o Qata aapka maara gaya kunba <br />
Baade shahe waala na raha puchne wala <br />
Gham apna baya'n kisse kare zainab e nashad<br />
 Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad</p>

<p>
3) Jab saamne Abid ke kabhi aata hai paani<br />
Yaad aati hai pyaaso'n ki bahot tashna dahani<br />
Chaalis baras baap ko rote rahe sajjad<br />
 Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad</p>

<p>
4) Kya ranj-o-masaib ka hua samna moula<br />
Kaise ho bayaa'n aata hai ab mu ko kaleja<br />
Itrat pa mohammed ki ye kya padgayi uftad<br />
 Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad</p>

<p>
5) Hai hai waled-e-shaam ne kaisa ghazab kiya<br />
Bin baap ka layeeno'n ne Baquar ko kardiya<br />
Zehre dagha se maare gaye syed-e-sajjad<br />
 Ya syed-e-sajjad ya syed-e-sajjad</p>

<p>
6) Hyder tha Ahlebait me ek hashr sa bapa<br />
Jab gusl o kafan Baquar-e-zijaan ne diya<br />
Baba pa jo sitam hue sub aagaye wo yaad</p>